---
layout: layouts/rearrange.njk
pagination:
  data: rearrangeAtlas.encounters
  size: 1
  alias: scene
permalink: "/stories/rearrange/{{ scene.slug }}/index.html"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ scene.title }}"
  description: "{{ scene.question }}"
---
<article class="edition-scene" data-story-node="{{ scene.slug }}" data-movement="{{ scene.movement }}" style="--movement-color: {{ scene.movementInfo.color }}">
  <div class="scene-sky" aria-hidden="true"><div class="cosmos-stars"></div><div class="scene-orbit"></div></div>
  <header class="scene-hero shell">
    <div class="scene-route"><a href="{{ '/stories/rearrange/' | relativeUrl(page.url) }}">← 返回星图</a><span>{% for lens in rearrangeAtlas.lenses %}{% if lens.id in scene.lenses %}{{ lens.title }} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}{{ scene.era }}</span></div>
    <p class="scene-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{{ scene.movementInfo.symbol }}</p><p class="scene-era">{{ scene.era }} · {{ scene.movementInfo.english }}</p>
    <h1>{{ scene.title }}</h1><p class="scene-question">{{ scene.question }}</p><p class="scene-lead">{{ scene.lead }}</p>
    <div class="scene-scroll-cue">往下读，线索会在故事中打开 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></div>
  </header>
  <div class="scene-reading-shell shell">
    <aside class="scene-rail" aria-label="阅读进度"><div class="scene-rail-inner"><p>MEMOIR / {{ scene.era }}</p><span>{{ scene.title }}</span><div class="scene-rail-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div><small>{{ scene.question }}</small><div class="scene-rail-progress" data-scene-progress></div></div></aside>
    <div class="scene-reading scene-narrative">
      {% for paragraph in scene.narrative.paragraphs %}
      <p data-fragment>{{ paragraph }}</p>
      {% if loop.index == scene.narrative.hingeAfter %}
      <aside class="crossing{% if scene.turn.kind == 'diary' %} crossing-present{% endif %}" aria-label="交叉线索"><div class="crossing-glyph" aria-hidden="true">✧</div><div><p>{{ '这一周，又写到这里' if scene.turn.kind == 'diary' else '还有一段经历与这里相连' }}</p><h3>{{ scene.turn.label }}</h3><span>{{ scene.turn.note }}</span></div><a href="{{ scene.turn.href | relativeUrl(page.url) }}">去读这一段 ↗</a></aside>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
      {% if scene.kind == 'diary' %}<p class="source-note">日记选段 · {{ scene.era }} · 保留原文</p>{% else %}<details class="source-note"><summary>这段故事从哪里来？</summary><p>这段叙事依据原书不同位置的内容重写并串联。以下是主要来源页码；不确定之处仍以原书材料为界。</p><ul>{% for passage in scene.passages %}<li>书页 {{ passage.page }} · {{ passage.title }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></details>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="scene-exit"><div class="shell scene-exit-inner"><div class="scene-exit-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FOLLOW THE RESONANCE</p><h2>这个问题，<br>还出现在哪里？</h2><p>这些联系通向不同年份，也通向正在写的生活。</p></div><div class="scene-exit-routes">{% for route in scene.routes %}<a href="{{ route.href | relativeUrl(page.url) }}"><span>{{ '日记 · ' ~ route.range if route.kind == 'diary' else '回忆录' }}</span><strong>{{ route.label }}</strong><p>{{ route.note }}</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>{% endfor %}<a class="route-map" href="{{ '/stories/rearrange/' | relativeUrl(page.url) }}">回到星图，从别处进入</a></div></div></section>
</article>
